  <title>Contribute to Griabuntu Mail</title>

  <p>Want to help improve Griabuntu Mail? There are a number of ways you can
  contribute:</p>

  <list>
    <item><p><link
    href="https://github.com/D3rPaPaH0d3n/griabuntu-mail">Bug
    reporting</link>—report new bugs or request new features</p></item>
    <item><p><link href="https://github.com/D3rPaPaH0d3n/griabuntu-mail">Translating</link>—translate Griabuntu Mail’s user interface and user manual into new languages</p></item>
    <item><p><link href="https://github.com/D3rPaPaH0d3n/griabuntu-mail">Development</link>—fix bugs and add new features</p></item>
  </list>

  <p>See <link href="https://github.com/D3rPaPaH0d3n/griabuntu-mail">the
  wiki</link> for more information and options for contributing
  financially to Griabuntu Mail's development.</p>
</page>
